  "label": "Rule of the Club Trope",
  "description": "A common comedic trope in popular culture where a club or group has a secret rule that members must not discuss the club or its rules. This trope is referenced in the meme's text ('the first rule of deaf club...') to create humor, but it is used here in a way that can be seen as offensive to the deaf community by implying secrecy or exclusivity.",
